   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<span style=\"color:LightSkyBlue\">\n",
    "\n",
    "We will also perform a log transformation of `CFC_add` and `CFC_times` since both of their histograms are very left-skewed."
