   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<span style=\"color:LightSkyBlue\">\n",
    "\n",
    "And we will use the preprocessing function `PolynomialFeatures` to create some features and see if there are any non-linear trends present."
