   "source": [
    "<span style=\"color:LightSkyBlue\">\n",
    "\n",
    "Additionally, since the data has a time-series aspect to it, we will create some features that will help this, such as:\n",
    "- each feature's moving average\n",
    "- each feature's difference from the moving average\n",
    "- a shift if required to account for leading or lagging differences\n",
    "- the difference in the current sample from the prior sample taken for each feature where relevant\n",
    "\n",
    "we will then standardise all these changes and use them as features as well, to mitigate the effect of scale from certain features."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
